  "semanticNotes": [
    "Ordinary text under default htmlLabels maps to Python measured lines; default remains true.",
    "Explicit rectangle labels replace prior label; bare references retain it; insertion order remains stable.",
    "Source positions retain raw Python indices and UTF-16 offsets/columns, line 1-based, span half-open.",
    "Literal backslash+n and actual line breaks produce multiline ordinary labels; per-line horizontal whitespace collapses.",
    "No global parser/DB/config state; each call owns new dictionaries and frozen outputs.",
    "nodeSpacing/rankSpacing are retained config values; pinned Mermaid ELK adapter does not consume them. No invented ELK mapping.",
    "Syntactically valid features outside this bounded language explicitly fail, rather than pretending complete flow.jison coverage.",
    "Only whole-line %% comments are parser whitespace, including EOF without trailing newline. Inline %% after header/node/edge/separator is invalid; detectType stripAnyComments is not parser semantics.",
    "S4 correction: FlowchartDiagramConfig redux-color/neo defaults win over global default/classic via config.ts resolveAppearance/setDiagramConfigScope. updateCurrentConfig rebuilds themeVariables from original initialize options.",
    "mermaidAPI.initialize bridges explicit fontFamily into themeVariables.fontFamily; no bridge exists for fontSize. Effective theme font is 14px, while site root fontSize defaults to 16 and is retained separately.",
    "squareRect look neo uses fixed horizontal/vertical padding 16/12. Legacy flowchart.padding default15 remains recorded but does not change neo rectangle padding.",
    "minNodeWidth and wrappingWidth default120 are explicit supported flowchart parameters; empty-label minimum-width exception is implemented at the Canvas measurement boundary.",
    "Prior global default/classic appearance and its passing local test expectations were incorrect source interpretation. Original S4 evidence is retained, not relabeled as equivalent."
  ],
